   "install": {
    "title": "Installation",
    "html": "<blockquote>\n<p>[!IMPORTANT]\nYou'll need a Vulkan compatible GPU (Graphics Card) to upscale images. Many iGPUs (integrated graphics) do not work but, no harm in trying :)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4>🐧 Linux</h4>\n  <a href=\"https://appimage.github.io/Upscayl/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/25067102/191270389-9de37c0f-39a8-41f1-a659-8dd4e7b8ac28.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  </a>  <a href=\"https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/upscayl-bin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/25067102/191269445-87050a77-c304-4284-9ea0-699721309c59.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  </a>  <a href=\"https://github.com/MrPenguin07/ebuilds\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl/assets/25067102/322aebc5-91aa-4fc6-ac3a-d5a054449554\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n  </a><p>Upscayl should be available on the software listings of most Linux operating systems. Your distro's Store app might also support the <a href=\"https://flatpak.org/setup\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flatpak</a> or Snap version.</p>\n<h5>💼 Portable Method</h5>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">releases section</a> or <a href=\"https://upscayl.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">our official website</a>.</li>\n<li>Download the <code>upscayl-x.x.x-linux.AppImage</code> file.</li>\n<li>Right Click AppImage -&gt; Go to Permissions tab -&gt; Check 'allow file to execute' and then double click the file to run Upscayl.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><em>You can also choose to install using other formats like RPM (Fedora), DEB (Debian/Ubuntu based), and ZIP (Any x86 Linux OS).</em></p>\n<h4>🍎 macOS</h4>\n<p>(MacOS 12 and later)</p>\n<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/upscayl/id6468265473?mt=12\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n  Link\n</a><ol>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">releases section</a> or <a href=\"https://upscayl.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">our official website</a>.</li>\n<li>Download the <code>upscayl-x.x.x-mac.dmg</code> file.</li>\n<li>Double click dmg, drag Upscayl icon into Applications folder.</li>\n<li>Open Finder, click 'Applications' tab in the left sidebar. Find Upscayl and right click on it. Select 'Open'.</li>\n<li>In the window that appears, press 'Open' yet again.</li>\n</ol>\n<h5>🍺 Homebrew</h5>\n<p><code>brew install --cask upscayl</code></p>\n<h4>🐌 Windows</h4>\n<p>(Windows 10 and later)</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">releases section</a> or <a href=\"https://upscayl.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">our official website</a>.</li>\n<li>Download the <code>upscayl-x.x.x-win.exe</code> file.</li>\n<li>Double click exe file to launch.</li>\n<li>If you get a SmartScreen warning - click 'More Info' and then 'Run Anyway' OR press 'YES' on the unverified publisher dialog.</li>\n<li>Follow the installation steps.</li>\n<li>Profit!</li>\n</ol>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 2401
   },
   "usage": {
    "title": "Documentation - Tutorials and Guides",
    "html": "<p>Check out our Documentation <a href=\"https://docs.upscayl.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/upscayl/custom-models\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Try out even more new models!</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl/wiki/%F0%9F%96%A5%EF%B8%8F-Model-Conversion---Create-more-AI-models!\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Convert your own models</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl/wiki/Compatibility-List\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Compatibility List</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl/wiki/Troubleshooting\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Troubleshooting</a></li>\n</ul>",
